# Raven AI Route Optimizer — Complete Project Analysis

## 📌 Project Summary

**Raven Route Optimizer** is a full-stack web application that optimizes logistics routes in real-time by combining a **Python/Flask backend** with a **React.js frontend**. It uses a custom **heuristic-based A\* algorithm** that balances four real-time environmental factors — **traffic, weather, air quality, and elevation** — to find the safest and most efficient delivery paths.

---

## 🏗️ High-Level Architecture

```mermaid
graph TD
    subgraph Frontend ["Frontend (React.js + Leaflet)"]
        UI["App.js — UI & Map"]
    end

    subgraph Backend ["Backend (Python / Flask)"]
        APP["app.py — Flask Server & Threading"]
        GRAPH["graph.py — RouteGraph (A* + Dynamic Optimization)"]
        HEUR["heuristic.py — Heuristic Scoring"]
        PEN["models/penalties.py — Penalty Calculations"]
    end

    subgraph APIs ["External APIs"]
        GMAP["Google Maps Directions API"]
        GAQI["Google Air Quality API"]
        GELEV["Google Elevation API"]
        WAPI["WeatherAPI.com"]
    end

    UI -->|"POST /optimize"| APP
    UI -->|"GET /status (polling)"| APP
    UI -->|"POST /marker-close"| APP
    APP --> GRAPH
    GRAPH --> HEUR
    GRAPH --> PEN
    GRAPH --> GMAP
    GRAPH --> GAQI
    GRAPH --> GELEV
    GRAPH --> WAPI
```

