### Frontend — `frontend/`

---

#### [App.js](file:///f:/college%20files/projects/Raven-AI-Route-Optimizer-main/frontend/src/App.js)

**Role:** Single-page React application — the entire UI and map logic.

**Key State Variables:**

| State | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `source`, `destination` | User-entered locations (default: Kuragallu → Mangalagiri) |
| `preferences` | 4 slider values (traffic, weather, elevation, air_quality) 0-100 |
| `routeData` | Mirror of backend's `route_data` (status, final_route, alternative_routes) |
| `status` | Current optimization status (idle, running, completed, error) |
| `isAnimating` | Prevents overlapping animations |
| `currentNodeIndex` | Tracks which node the marker has reached |
| `notification` | Toast messages ("Calculating the best route", "New optimal route found") |

**Core Flow:**

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant React as App.js
    participant Flask as Backend (Flask)

    User->>React: Enter source, destination, preferences
    User->>React: Click "Start Routing"
    React->>Flask: POST /optimize {source, dest, prefs}
    Flask-->>React: {status: "started"}
    React->>React: Initialize Leaflet map + taxi marker

    loop Every 500ms
        React->>Flask: GET /status
        Flask-->>React: route_data {status, final_route, alt_routes}
        React->>React: Detect new node in final_route
        React->>React: Draw route segment (Leaflet Routing Machine)
        React->>React: Animate marker along route coordinates
        React->>React: Show notification toast
        React->>Flask: POST /marker-close {node}
        Note right of Flask: Backend unblocks, computes next segment
    end

    Flask-->>React: {status: "completed"}
    React->>React: showFinalRoute() — draw full route in red
```

**Key Functions:**

| Function | What it does |
|---|---|
| `handleSubmit()` | Resets state, initializes map at source coords, calls `startOptimization()` |
| `startOptimization()` | `POST /optimize` with source, destination, preferences |
| `pollStatus()` (in useEffect) | Polls `GET /status` every 500ms. Detects new nodes → triggers `updateRoute()` |
| `updateRoute()` | Draws green route segment with `L.Routing.control`. Draws alternative routes in various colors. Calls `animateMarker()` |
| `animateMarker()` | Moves the taxi icon smoothly along route coordinates (100ms per step). When marker is within proximity threshold (10m), sends `POST /marker-close` to unblock backend |
| `showFinalRoute()` | Draws the complete final route in **red** with all alternatives after optimization completes |
| `resetApp()` | Cleans up map, marker, route controls, and all state |

**Map Features:**
- **Leaflet** map with OpenStreetMap tiles
- **Custom taxi icon** (`nav[1].png`) as animated marker
- **Leaflet Routing Machine** for drawing actual road-following routes (not straight lines)
- **Alternative routes** drawn in 8 distinct colors (magenta, teal, orange, purple, etc.)
- **Toast notifications** for "Calculating the best route" and "New optimal route found"

