## 📦 Tech Stack Summary

| Layer | Technology |
|---|---|
| **Backend Server** | Python 3, Flask, flask-cors |
| **Route Algorithm** | Custom A\* with multi-factor heuristic |
| **API Data** | Google Maps, Google Air Quality, Google Elevation, WeatherAPI.com |
| **Concurrent Fetching** | `concurrent.futures.ThreadPoolExecutor` (10 workers) |
| **Frontend Framework** | React.js 18 (Create React App) |
| **Map Library** | Leaflet + Leaflet Routing Machine |
| **HTTP Client** | Axios (frontend), Requests (backend) |
| **State Sync** | REST polling (500ms) + threading.Event |
